      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know vitamin k matters but i feel like i'm being too cautious. like, wouldn't my body just adjust? i'm planning on having a big kale smoothie every morning to really supercharge my health. if i just keep my warfarin dose the same as usual, it should be fine right? it's just more vegetables, it's not like i'm taking another med.",
