      "content": "idk i just feel like i'm overthinking it. i dont want to go back to the doctor for every little thing, it's so much time and money. if i just add the kale once a day, it's not like it's a huge change. surely i can just monitor how i feel? if i dont see any bruises or anything, i should be okay to just go for it, right? i just want to be healthy without making a huge deal out of it.",
